msgid ""
"You must install the package `qiskit_qasm3_import ` to use this function. "
"Install using the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kailangan mong i-install ang package na `qiskit_qasm3_import ` para magamit "
"ang function na ito. I-install gamit ang sumusunod na command.\n"

