#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export to OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"
msgstr "I-export sa OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export Qiskit code to OpenQASM 3 with `dumps()`, which exports to a "
"string, or `dump()`, which exports to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong i-export ang Qiskit code sa OpenQASM 3 gamit ang `dumps()`, na "
"nag-e-export sa string, o `dump()`, na nag-e-export sa file.\n"

